<input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="{{csrf}}">
<div class="editor-grid"><section class="panel editor-content"><div class="panel-heading"><span class="panel-heading-icon">{{> icon name="edit"}}</span><div><h2>Announcement details</h2><p>A clear title and thoughtful message go a long way.</p></div></div><label for="announcement-title">Title <span class="required-marker">*</span></label><input id="announcement-title" name="title" value="{{announcement.title}}" maxlength="255" required placeholder="Give your announcement a clear, descriptive title"><div class="field-help"><span>Keep it concise and easy to recognize.</span><span data-title-count>0 / 255</span></div><label for="announcement-content">Message <span class="required-marker">*</span></label><textarea id="announcement-content" name="content" rows="12" maxlength="60000" required placeholder="Write the details your community needs to know...">{{announcement.content}}</textarea><p class="field-help">Plain text is supported. Line breaks will be preserved.</p></section>
<aside class="editor-options"><section class="panel"><h2>Publication</h2><p class="section-description">Choose when your update becomes visible.</p><label for="announcement-status">Status</label><select id="announcement-status" name="status"><option value="draft" {{#if (eq announcement.status 'draft')}}selected{{/if}}>Draft &mdash; only you can see it</option><option value="published" {{#if (eq announcement.status 'published')}}selected{{/if}}>Published &mdash; visible to recipients</option></select><div class="form-note">{{> icon name="shield"}}<p>Drafts never send notifications. Publishing notifies your selected audience, excluding you.</p></div></section><section class="panel"><h2>Who is this for?</h2><label for="announcement-audience">Audience</label><select id="announcement-audience" name="audience"><option value="all">All Members</option><option value="specific" {{#if (eq announcement.audience 'specific')}}selected{{/if}}>Specific users or roles</option></select><p class="field-help">All Members includes every registered Admin, Staff and Visitor.</p><div data-recipient-fields><fieldset><legend>Select roles</legend>{{#each roleChoices}}<label class="choice"><input type="checkbox" name="recipientRoles" value="{{role}}" {{#if selected}}checked{{/if}}><span class="capitalize">{{role}}</span></label>{{/each}}</fieldset><fieldset><legend>Select individual users</legend><div class="recipient-list">{{#each users}}<label class="choice"><input type="checkbox" name="recipientIds" value="{{id}}" {{#if selected}}checked{{/if}}><span>{{name}}<small class="capitalize">{{role}}</small></span></label>{{else}}<p class="field-help">No registered recipients found.</p>{{/each}}</div></fieldset></div></section></aside></div>
<div class="editor-footer"><span>{{#if editing}}Original author and publication history are preserved.{{else}}Your announcement will be saved to the workspace.{{/if}}</span><div class="button-row"><a class="button secondary" href="/announcements">Cancel</a><button class="button" type="submit" data-save-announcement>{{> icon name="check"}}<span>{{#if editing}}Save changes{{else}}Save draft{{/if}}</span></button></div></div>
